## 2. What the Orbit API provides

All endpoints live under `https://<your-orbit>/api/v0/`, Bearer-token auth
(token created in Orbit admin settings; sent as
`{'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + <token>}` on every request).

| Resource | Endpoint | What it is | Lake role |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Robots** | `GET /robots`, `/robots/{hostname}` | Fleet registry: robots, slot assignments | Reference data |
| **Runs** | `GET /runs/`, `/runs/{uuid}` | One execution of a mission or teleop session | Core fact table |
| **RunEvents** | `GET /run_events/`, `/run_events/{uuid}` | Actions inside a run | Child of Run |
| **RunCaptures** | `GET /run_captures/`, `/run_captures/{uuid}` | Captured data points (thermal image, gauge reading, …), linked to a RunEvent | The inspection data itself |
| **Run Archives** | `GET /run_archives/{runId}` | Zip of a whole run's data — bulk download | Bulk ingest / backfill |
| **Run log** | `GET /runs/{uuid}/log` | Robot log for the run (robot_state / BDDF-style content) | Telemetry |
| **SiteWalks** | `GET /site_walks/`, `/{uuid}` | Mission definitions (the *plan*, vs runs = the *execution*) | Reference / dimension |
| **SiteElements** | `GET /site_elements/{uuid}` | Tasks within a SiteWalk, attempted in sequence | Reference / dimension |
| **SiteDocks** | `GET /site_docks/{uuid}` | Dock definitions | Reference / dimension |
| **Missions** | `GET /missions`, `/{missionId}` | Mission info | Reference |
| **Calendar** | `GET /calendar/schedule` | Scheduled mission events | Reference |
| **Anomalies** | `GET /anomalies` (`PATCH` to triage/close) | Flagged findings from data review — high value | Gold-feeding fact |
| **Run Statistics** | `GET /run_statistics/sessions`, `/sessions_summary` | Pre-aggregated session stats | Shortcut to Gold |
| **Facets** | `GET /runs/facets/robots\|missions\|actions` | Pre-built unique lists + counts | Shortcut to Gold |
| **Webhooks** | `GET/POST /webhooks`, `/{uuid}` | Callback registration on Orbit | Near-real-time ingest trigger |
| **Backups** | `GET/POST /backup_tasks`, `GET /backups/{taskId}` | Orbit instance backup tar files | Ops / disaster recovery (not lake data) |
| **Version / system time** | `GET /version`, `GET /settings/system-time` | Instance metadata | `_meta/` bookkeeping |

### 2.1 Object model

```text
SiteWalk (the mission plan: SiteElements + SiteDocks in sequence)
└── Run (one execution — mission or teleop)
    ├── RunEvent (an action; a run has many)
    │   └── RunCapture (a data point; an event has many)
    └── Run log (robot-side telemetry for the run)

Anomaly ──(references)──▶ capture / site element
