## 3. Lake structure

```text
data-lake/
│
├── 00-landing/                          # Raw, exactly as received from Orbit
│   ├── run_archives/                    # Zips from /run_archives/{runId}
│   │   └── dt=2026-09-01/run=<uuid>.zip
│   ├── images/                          # Image bytes for run captures
│   │   └── capture=<uuid>.<fmt> + capture=<uuid>.json (sidecar metadata)
│   ├── run_logs/                        # /runs/{uuid}/log raw payloads
│   │   └── run=<uuid>_log.json
│   ├── webhooks_events/                 # Raw webhook callback payloads
│   │   └── dt=.../<uuid>.json
│   └── api_snapshots/                   # Periodic full-resource GET dumps
│       └── <resource>/dt=.../snapshot.json    # robots, site_walks, calendar, anomalies
│
├── 01-bronze/                           # 1:1 with the Orbit OAS3 schemas — JSON → Parquet
│   ├── runs/                            # dt=<date>/part-*.parquet
│   ├── run_events/
│   ├── run_captures/                    # metadata row per capture (bytes stay as files)
│   ├── anomalies/
│   ├── webhooks_events/                 # typed webhook events
│   ├── _ref_robots/                     # slowly-changing: snapshot + SCD-2 versioning
│   ├── _ref_site_walks/
│   ├── _ref_site_elements/
│   ├── _ref_site_docks/
│   ├── _ref_missions/
│   ├── _ref_calendar/
│   └── _quarantine/                     # failed validation, never silently dropped
│
├── 02-silver/                           # Cleaned, conformed, joined
│   ├── sessions/                        # one row per run: robot, mission, started_at,
│   │                                    #   duration, event_count, capture_count, status
│   ├── run_events_flat/                 # actions exploded, typed, parent run joined
│   ├── captures_index/                  # every capture: type, run event, waypoint,
│   │                                    #   media uri, pose, UTC capture time
│   ├── telemetry/                       # parsed from run logs (battery, faults, odom)
│   └── events/                          # unified timeline: anomalies, faults, failures
│
├── 03-gold/                             # Analytics / feature layer
│   ├── mission_success_rate/            # per mission, per robot, per day
│   ├── inspection_results/              # captures joined to anomalies — "the findings"
│   ├── fleet_utilization_daily/
│   ├── robot_health_metrics/            # fault rates, battery cycles, downtime
│   ├── anomaly_pipeline/                # open → triage → close cycle times (Anomalies API)
│   └── session_statistics/              # seeded from /run_statistics as fast-start,
│                                        #   reconciled against own aggregations
│
└── _meta/
    ├── orbit_instances/                 # instance hostname, API version, token scope
    ├── schemas/                         # pinned OpenAPI spec + Orbit object models
    └── ingestion/                       # per-resource watermarks: last_uuid,
                                         #   last_run_started_at
```

